{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Encoding.Ptr_sort</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"soteria","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Soteria","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Bv_values","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Encoding","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Ptr_sort","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Raw pointers are encoded as a pair datatype of location and offset, declared on the fly through <a href=\"../../../Solvers/Decls/index.html\"><code>Solvers.Decls</code></a>. Exposed to allow extensions to depend on it.</p><p>A pointer of width <code>n</code> is encoded as a datatype with two fields, both bitvectors of width <code>n</code>: the location and the offset.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-name\"><a href=\"#val-name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> name : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The SMT-LIB sort for <code>n</code>-bit pointers.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-con\"><a href=\"#val-con\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> con : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The SMT-LIB constructor for <code>n</code>-bit pointers; receives the location and offset as arguments.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-mk_ptr\"><a href=\"#val-mk_ptr\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> mk_ptr : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The SMT-LIB constructor for <code>n</code>-bit pointers, applied to the location and offset terms.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-loc_sel\"><a href=\"#val-loc_sel\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> loc_sel : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The SMT-LIB selector for the location of <code>n</code>-bit pointers.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_loc\"><a href=\"#val-get_loc\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_loc : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The SMT-LIB selector for the location of <code>n</code>-bit pointers, applied to a pointer term.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-ofs_sel\"><a href=\"#val-ofs_sel\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> ofs_sel : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The SMT-LIB selector for the offset of <code>n</code>-bit pointers.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_ofs\"><a href=\"#val-get_ofs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_ofs : <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../../Smt/index.html#type-sexp\">Smt.sexp</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&g